sequenceDiagram
  participant harness as Owned-lab harness
  participant client as Persistent SQL client
  participant proxy as Two PgCat replicas
  participant primary as Current primary
  participant replica as Replica
  participant dcs as Kubernetes DCS
  client->>proxy: Continuous committed-ID transactions
  proxy->>primary: Writes
  primary->>dcs: Leader lock heartbeat
  harness->>primary: Inject primary loss in owned lab
  replica->>dcs: Observe leadership expiry / acquire lock
  replica->>replica: Promote
  proxy->>replica: Route new primary connections
  client->>proxy: Reconnect after failures
  client->>replica: Compare all acknowledged IDs
